{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"language":"python","display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12.12","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceId":14594049,"sourceType":"datasetVersion","datasetId":9322198},{"sourceId":14603939,"sourceType":"datasetVersion","datasetId":9328307}],"dockerImageVersionId":31260,"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false}},"nbformat_minor":4,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# 🛠️ 环境准备与权限校验 (Environment Setup & Verification)\n\n本阶段已完成工作空间初始化，并确保所有核心脚本具备执行权限。\n\n### 1. 文件完整性检查\n通过 `ls` 校验，确认以下核心组件已就绪：\n*   **Python 脚本**: `preprocess_data.py`, `monitor_training.py`, `test_inference.py`\n*   **配置中心**: `train_config.yaml`, `export_config.yaml`\n*   **说明文档**: `README.md`, `FILE_LIST.md`\n\n### 2. 权限自动化配置\n已通过 `os.stat` 模块对 Shell 脚本批量授予执行权限（Executable Permissions）：\n*   `setup.sh` (环境安装)\n*   `train.sh` (训练主程序)\n*   `run_all.sh` (全流程自动化)\n*   `cleanup.sh` & `export_and_quantize.sh`\n\n> **验证状态**: ✅ `rwxr-xr-x` 权限已生效。\n\n### 3. 结果汇总\n目前 `/kaggle/working` 目录已达到训练就绪状态（Ready-to-Train）。\n*注意：由于尚未生成模型，目前目录不含 `.json` 配置文件。*\n### 4. 环境依赖部署 (Dependency Deployment)\n已执行 `setup.sh` 脚本，完成以下初始化任务：\n*   **依赖安装**：根据 `requirements.txt` 配置 Python 运行环境。\n*   **路径初始化**：建立训练所需的临时目录和输出目录。\n*   **环境验证**：底层驱动与核心库（如 CUDA/PyTorch）适配完成。\n\n> **状态更新**：🚀 系统依赖已安装，环境已切换至“训练待命”模式。\n","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import shutil\nimport os\n\n# 修正后的源目录和目标路径\nsrc = '/kaggle/input/imptdar' \ndst = '/kaggle/working/'\n\n# 将所有文件复制到 working 目录并赋予执行权限\nif os.path.exists(src):\n    for item in os.listdir(src):\n        s = os.path.join(src, item)\n        d = os.path.join(dst, item)\n        # 避免复制文件夹（如果是文件夹需用 copytree）\n        if os.path.isfile(s):\n            shutil.copy2(s, d)\n            # 如果是脚本，赋予执行权限\n            if item.endswith('.sh'):\n                os.chmod(d, 0o755)\n    print(\"✅ 脚本已成功迁移至 /kaggle/working 并配置执行权限\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"❌ 找不到源目录: {src}，请检查 Dataset 名称是否正确\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T01:05:27.717822Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T01:05:27.718632Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-01-25T01:05:27.784956Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-01-25T01:05:27.718594Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-01-25T01:05:27.784405Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"✅ 脚本已成功迁移至 /kaggle/working 并配置执行权限\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":4},{"cell_type":"code","source":"import yaml\n\n# 1. 复制原始文件到工作目录\n!cp /kaggle/input/imptdar/train_config.yaml /kaggle/working/train_config.yaml\n\ndef set_smoke_mode():\n    with open('train_config.yaml', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        # 使用 Loader=yaml.FullLoader 确保安全加载\n        cfg = yaml.load(f, Loader=yaml.FullLoader)\n\n    # 修改为冒烟测试参数\n    smoke_updates = {\n        'num_train_epochs': 1,\n        'per_device_train_batch_size': 1,\n        'gradient_accumulation_steps': 2,\n        'cutoff_len': 512,\n        'lora_rank': 8,\n        'lora_alpha': 16,\n        'eval_steps': 10,\n        'save_steps': 10,\n        'max_samples': 45  # 你的全量数据\n    }\n    cfg.update(smoke_updates)\n\n    with open('train_config.yaml', 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        yaml.dump(cfg, f, default_flow_style=False, sort_keys=False, allow_unicode=True)\n    print(\"✅ 已切换至【冒烟测试】模式：单步微调，快速验证流程。\")\n\nset_smoke_mode()","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T01:05:59.352027Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T01:05:59.352348Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-01-25T01:05:59.480319Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-01-25T01:05:59.352317Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-01-25T01:05:59.479494Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"✅ 已切换至【冒烟测试】模式：单步微调，快速验证流程。\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":8},{"cell_type":"code","source":"!bas