o account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\ngoogle-adk 1.22.1 requires google-cloud-bigquery-storage>=2.0.0, which is not installed.\nbigframes 2.26.0 requires google-cloud-bigquery-storage<3.0.0,>=2.30.0, which is not installed.\nlangchain-core 0.3.79 requires packaging<26.0.0,>=23.2.0, but you have packaging 26.0rc2 which is incompatible.\ncudf-cu12 25.6.0 requires pyarrow<20.0.0a0,>=14.0.0; platform_machine == \"x86_64\", but you have pyarrow 22.0.0 which is incompatible.\nbigframes 2.26.0 requires rich<14,>=12.4.4, but you have rich 14.2.0 which is incompatible.\nfastai 2.8.4 requires fastcore<1.9,>=1.8.0, but you have fastcore 1.11.3 which is incompatible.\u001b[0m\u001b[31m\n\u001b[0m✓ LLaMA-Factory 版本: 0.9.5.dev0\n✓ LLaMA-Factory 安装完成\n[4/6] 创建 dataset_info.json...\n✓ 数据集配置完成\n[5/6] 运行数据预处理...\n\n============================================================\nQwen2-VL 数据预处理启动\n============================================================\n\n============================================================\n处理文件: /kaggle/input/fitness-rehab-vlm/train.json\n============================================================\n✓ 加载了 45 个样本\n\n============================================================\n处理完成统计:\n  ✓ 有效样本: 45\n  ✗ 无效样本: 0\n  → 保存路径: /kaggle/temp/train.json\n============================================================\n\n✓ 第一个样本预览:\n{\n  \"id\": \"lunge_side_standard_0001\",\n  \"image\": \"images/lunge/lunge__side__standard__none__0001.jpg\",\n  \"action\": \"lunge\",\n  \"view\": \"side\",\n  \"sample_type\": \"standard\",\n  \"error_type\": \"none\",\n  \"conversations\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"human\",\n      \"value\": \"<image>\\n请检查我的弓步蹲动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"gpt\",\n      \"value\": \"【推理过程】：\\n1. 检测下肢力线：侧观前后腿膝关节均呈 90 度夹角。\\n2. 判定代偿：躯干垂直地面，脊柱中立，重心稳定分布。\\n3. 解决策略：维持现有幅度，确保膝盖投影未超脚尖。\\n\\n【判定结果】：\\n标准动作。力线理想，作为全体型训练基准。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"images\": [\n    \"/kaggle/...\n\n============================================================\n处理文件: /kaggle/input/fitness-rehab-vlm/val.json\n============================================================\n✓ 加载了 9 个样本\n\n============================================================\n处理完成统计:\n  ✓ 有效样本: 9\n  ✗ 无效样本: 0\n  → 保存路径: /kaggle/temp/val.json\n============================================================\n\n✓ 第一个样本预览:\n{\n  \"id\": \"squat__side__standard__none__0016\",\n  \"image\": \"images/squat/squat__side__standard__none__0016.jpg\",\n  \"conversations\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"human\",\n      \"value\": \"<image>\\n请检查我的深蹲动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"gpt\",\n      \"value\": \"【推理过程】:\\n1. 侧面观察髋、膝、踝三点形成稳定垂直力线。\\n2. 躯干直立，脊柱中立，无圆背。\\n3. 大腿下蹲接近平行地面。\\n【判定结果】:\\n标准深蹲，可作为侧面正确样本。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"action\": \"squat\",\n  \"view\": \"side\",\n  \"sample_type\": \"standard\",\n  \"error_type\": \"none\",\n  \"images\": [\n    \"/kaggle/input/fitness-rehab-vlm/im...\n\n============================================================\n✓ 数据预处理全部完成！\n✓ 输出目录: /kaggle/temp\n============================================================\n\n✓ 数据预处理完成\n[6/6] 创建训练配置文件...\n✓ 配置文件已创建完成\n✓ 导出配置文件已创建: export_config.yaml\n\n==========================================\n✓ 环境初始化完成！(T4×2 GPU)\n==========================================\n\n配置摘要:\n  • GPU: T4×2 (每卡 16GB 显存)\n  • 精度: FP16 (T4 原生支持)\n  • Batch size: 1 per GPU\n  • 梯度累积: 16 步\n  • 等效 batch size: 32 (1×2×16)\n  • LoRA Rank: 16 (显存优化)\n  • 序列长度: 2048 (降低以节省显存)\n  • 优化器: AdamW 8bit\n  • 预计训练时长: 16-24 小时\n\n⚠️  16GB 显存优化提示:\n  • 已降低 LoRA rank (32→16)\n  • 已降低序列长度 (4096→2048)\n  • 已启用 8bit 优化器\n  • 如仍 OOM，可进一步降低 cutoff_len 至 1024\n\n下一步操作：\n  1. 运行训练: bash train.sh\n  2. 导出模型: bash export_and_quantize.sh\n\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":9},{"cell_type":"code","source":"!bash /kaggle/working/train.sh","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-01-25T01:07:59.981441Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-25T01:0